WEBVTT

00:00:04.682 --> 00:00:07.797
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Have you seen</b> the new Ryan Gosling movie?

00:00:07.989 --> 00:00:09.477
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, <b>I have</b>.

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:15.485
<b>She hasn’t read</b> any books in English.

00:00:19.622 --> 00:00:21.974
<b>Have you ever read</b> a French novel?

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:27.155
<b>I’ve never worked</b> in an office.

00:00:31.376 --> 00:00:33.468
<b>Have you finished</b> the exercise?

00:00:36.728 --> 00:00:39.840
<b>Your parents have arrived</b>. They’re in the living room.